              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "How to Set Up Your KPIs:  ",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontWeight": "bold",
                      "textDecoration": "underline"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "The Power KPIs visual does not currently support automatic creation of thresholds for KPI indicators, such as “show as a green circle if Variance is within -2% and higher”.  Instead, there are two ways you can define your KPI indicators:"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": ""
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Method 1:  Include a Column with the desired KPI index in your data model. ",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontWeight": "bold",
                      "fontSize": "11pt"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "     ",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontWeight": "bold",
                      "fontSize": "11pt"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "value": "An ",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "11pt"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "value": "advantage with this approach is you are not bound to a threshold rule that"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "     may need to be constantly tweaked.  Assuming you use either a"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "     live/direct connection or scheduled refresh, you may update the KPIs that"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "     show with the latest data without needing to open, modify and republish your pbix.  "
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": ""
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "  "
                  },
                  {
                    "value": "Column type",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "11pt",
                      "textDecoration": "underline"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "value": ": whole number (integer)",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "11pt"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "  "
                  },
                  {
                    "value": "Values:  ",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "11pt",
                      "textDecoration": "underline"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "value": "1, 2, 3, 4, or 5",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "11pt"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": ""
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "In the Field pane, drop your column (called \"",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "11pt"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "value": "KPI Fixed",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "11pt",
                      "textDecoration": "underline"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "value": "\" in the sample file) on to the ",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "11pt"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "value": "KPI Symbol Index ",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontWeight": "bold",
                      "fontSize": "11pt"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "value": "field well. The values will then correspond to the shape and color of the KPI symbol you define in the ",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "11pt"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "value": "KPI Indicator ",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontWeight": "bold",
                      "fontSize": "11pt"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "value": "section of the Format Pane in PBI Desktop (shown at right)",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "11pt"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": ""
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Method 2: Add a Calculated Column(s)",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontWeight": "bold",
                      "fontSize": "11pt"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "value": " to your model and set your own automatic",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "11pt"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "value": " thresholds.  Example: I have a table with two columns of metric values:  1) Actuals and 2) Target"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": ""
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "  * "
                  },
