                    "value": "Add a new Calculated Column called “Variance” that looks at the % difference between my two metrics",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "11pt"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": ""
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": " * Add a second Calculated Column called “KPI Index” that results in the KPI index values of 1|2|3 based on the range of Variance.  Here is some sample DAX:",
