                  {
                    "value": "KPI Symbol Index ",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontWeight": "bold",
                      "fontSize": "11pt"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "value": "field well. Combined with the same KPI Symbol formatting as shown in Method 1, this example formula says, “if the variance is greater or equal to 5 percent, show a ",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "11pt"
                    }
                  },
